This is an existing message with no DKIM signature of its own. Replaying it
through carriers-testkit shows how such a message is distributed and how the
delivered copy scores at a subscriber's server (its own list DKIM and ARC
seal are valid, but the author domain cannot pass DMARC via DKIM).
